Z||000012||fierosound||10-17-2000||09:45 PM||||Those are FOCOA headers, I've got the same on my 3.4L, but I got the Jet-Hot coated set.  Yes, they fit stock 2.8L Fieros and will bolt-up to the stock exhaust.  Even the original heat shielding around the y-pipe can be trimmed to fit.  Only the alternator coolong tube needs to be removed (or modified).  Looks GREAT in chrome!!!||||reg||10
